+    // @Description: This controls optional EKF behaviour. Setting JammingExpected will change the EKF nehaviour such that if dead reckoning navigation is possible it will require the preflight alignment GPS quality checks controlled by EK3_GPS_CHECK and EK3_CHECK_SCALE to pass before resuming GPS use if GPS lock is lost for more than 2 seconds to prevent bad. Setting ExtPosCanBootstrap allows MAV_CMD_EXTERNAL_POSITION_ESTIMATE (43003) to transition the filter from AID_NONE to AID_ABSOLUTE when the vehicle is in flight, enabling GPS-free navigation with a companion-computer position source. Also unblocks LOCAL_POSITION_NED publication on the ground once SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN is provided so the companion can come up before takeoff.
+    // @Bitmask: 0:JammingExpected, 3:ExtPosCanBootstrap
